#: glance/scrubber.py:42 glance/store/__init__.py:58
msgid "The amount of time in seconds to delay before performing a delete."
msgstr ""
"Die hoeveelheid tyd in sekondes tot vertraging voordat 'n skrap uitvoer."

#: glance/scrubber.py:40
msgid ""
"The size of thread pool to be used for scrubbing images. The default is one, "
"which signifies serial scrubbing. Any value above one indicates the max "
"number of images that may be scrubbed in parallel."
msgstr ""
"Die grootte van thread poel wat gebruik moet word vir beelde te skrop. Die "
"verstek is een, watter aandui serie skrop. Enige waarde bo een dui die "
"maksimum aantal beelde aan wat parallel geskrop mag word."

#: glance/store/__init__.py:53
msgid "Turn on/off delayed delete."
msgstr "Draaid op/af vertragingde skrap."

#: glance/api/middleware/context.py:33
msgid "Role used to identify an authenticated user as administrator."
msgstr ""
"Rol wat gebruik word om 'n outentiseer gebruiker as administrateur te "
"identifiseer."

#: glance/scrubber.py:51 glance/registry/client/v1/api.py:34
msgid ""
"Whether to pass through headers containing user and tenant information when "
"making requests to the registry. This allows the registry to use the context "
"middleware without keystonemiddleware's auth_token middleware, removing "
"calls to the keystone auth service. It is recommended that when using this "
"option, secure communication between glance api and glance registry is "
"ensured by means other than auth_token middleware."
msgstr ""
"Whether om deur opskrifte wat gebruiker- en huurderinligting bevat, deur te "
"gaan wanneer versoeke aan die register gerig word. Dit laat die register toe "
"om die konteksmiddelware te gebruik sonder keystonemiddleware se auth_token-"
"middelware, wat oproepe na die keystone-bekragtigingsdiens verwyder. Dit "
"word aanbeveel dat, wanneer hierdie opsie gebruik word, veilige kommunikasie "
"tussen blik-api en blikregister verseker word op ander maniere as auth_token-"
"middelware."

#: glance/scrubber.py:64
msgid "Loop time between checking for new items to schedule for delete."
msgstr "Loop tyd tussen kyk vir nuwe items om te skeduleer vir uitvee."

#: glance/scrubber.py:72
msgid ""
"Run as a long-running process. When not specified (the default) run the "
"scrub operation once and then exits. When specified do not exit and run "
"scrub on wakeup_time interval as specified in the config."
msgstr ""
"Hardloop as 'n lang lopende proses. Wanneer dit nie gespesifiseer is nie "
"(die verstek), voer die skropbewerking een keer uit en sluit dan af. Wanneer "
"gespesifiseer, moet u nie uitgaan en skrop op wakeup_time interval uitvoer "
"soos gespesifiseer in die konfigurasie nie."

