#: glance/api/versions.py:27 glance/api/glare/versions.py:28
msgid ""
"Public url to use for versions endpoint. The default is None, which will use "
"the request's host_url attribute to populate the URL base. If Glance is "
"operating behind a proxy, you will want to change this to represent the "
"proxy's URL."
msgstr ""
"Publieke url om te gebruik vir weergawes-eindpunt. Die verstek is Geeneen, "
"wat die versoek se host_url-kenmerk sal gebruik om die URL-basis te vul. "
"Indien Glance is operasieagter 'n proxy, sal jy dit wil verander om die "
"proxy se URL te verteenwoordig."

