#: glance/api/middleware/context.py:28
msgid ""
"When true, this option sets the owner of an image to be the tenant. "
"Otherwise, the owner of the  image will be the authenticated user issuing "
"the request."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer dit waar is, stel hierdie opsie die eienaar van 'n prent as die "
"huurder. Andersins, die eienaar van die prent sal die geoutentiseer "
"gebruiker wees wat die versoek uitreik."

#: glance/api/middleware/context.py:36
msgid ""
"Allow unauthenticated users to access the API with read-only privileges. "
"This only applies when using ContextMiddleware."
msgstr ""
"Laat ungeoutentiseer gebruikers toe om toegang tot die API met leesalleen-"
"regte te verkry. Dit is slegs van toepassing wanneer ContextMiddleware "
"gebruik word."

