"registerbediener, indien enige. Alternatiewelik kan jy die "
"GLANCE_CLIENT_CERT_FILE omgewingsveranderlike na 'n lêerpad van die CA-"
"sertifikaatlêer"

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:36
msgid ""
"The path to the certifying authority cert file to use in SSL connections to "
"the registry server, if any. Alternately, you may set the "
"GLANCE_CLIENT_CA_FILE environment variable to a filepath of the CA cert file."
msgstr ""
"Die pad na die sertifiseringsowerheid-sertifikaatlêer om in SSL-verbindings "
"met die registerbediener te gebruik, indien enige. Alternatiewelik kan jy "
"die GLANCE_CLIENT_CA_FILE omgewingsveranderlike na 'n lêerpad van die CA-"
"sertifikaatlêer."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:42
msgid ""
"When using SSL in connections to the registry server, do not require "
"validation via a certifying authority. This is the registry's equivalent of "
"specifying --insecure on the command line using glanceclient for the API."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer SSL gebruik word in verbindings met die registerbediener, vereis nie "
"bekragtiging via 'n sertifiseringsowerheid nie. Dit is die register se "
"ekwivalent van spesifiseer --insecure op die opdragreël met behulp van "
"glanceclient vir die API."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:36
msgid ""
"The period of time, in seconds, that the API server will wait for a registry "
"request to complete. A value of 0 implies no timeout."
msgstr ""
"Die tydperk, in sekondes, wat die API-bediener sal wag vir 'n "
"registerversoek om te voltooi. 'n Waarde van 0 impliseer geen uitteltyd nie."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:64
msgid ""
"Whether to pass through the user token when making requests to the registry. "
"To prevent failures with token expiration during big files upload, it is "
"recommended to set this parameter to False.If \"use_user_token\" is not in "
"effect, then admin credentials can be specified."
msgstr ""
"Whether om deur die gebruikerstoken te gaan wanneer versoeke aan die "
"register gerig word. Om mislukkings te voorkom met tekenverval tydens die "
"oplaai van groot lêers, dit word aanbeveel om hierdie parameter op Vals. If "
"te stel \"use_user_token\" nie in werking is nie, kan admin-geloofsbriewe "
"gespesifiseer word."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:73
msgid ""
"The administrators user name. If \"use_user_token\" is not in effect, then "
"admin credentials can be specified."
msgstr ""
"Die administrateurs gebruiker naam. Indien \"use_user_token\" nie in werking "
"is nie, kan admin-geloofsbriewe gespesifiseer word."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:78
msgid ""
"The administrators password. If \"use_user_token\" is not in effect, then "
"admin credentials can be specified."
msgstr ""
"Die administrateurs wagwoord. Indien \"use_user_token\" nie in werking is "
"nie, kan admin-geloofsbriewe gespesifiseer word."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:83
msgid ""
"The tenant name of the administrative user. If \"use_user_token\" is not in "
"effect, then admin tenant name can be specified."
msgstr ""
"Die huurdernaam van die administratiewe gebruiker. Inndien "
"\"use_user_token\" nie van krag is nie, kan die naam van die adminhuurder "
"gespesifiseer word."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:88
msgid ""
"The URL to the keystone service. If \"use_user_token\" is not in effect and "
"using keystone auth, then URL of keystone can be specified."
msgstr ""
"Die URL na die keystone diens. Indien \"use_user_token\" is nie in effek en "
"gebruik keystone auth, dan URL van keystone gespesifiseer kan word."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:94
msgid ""
"The strategy to use for authentication. If \"use_user_token\" is not in "
"effect, then auth strategy can be specified."
msgstr ""
"Die strategie om te gebruik vir waarmerking. Indien \"use_user_token\" is "
"nie in effek, dan auth strategie gespesifiseer kan word."

#: glance/registry/client/__init__.py:99
msgid ""
"The region for the authentication service. If \"use_user_token\" is not in "
"effect and using keystone auth, then region name can be specified."
msgstr ""
"Die streek vir die waarmerking diens. Indien \"use_user_token\" is nie in "
"effek en gebruik keystone auth, dan kan streeknaam gespesifiseer word."

#: glance/registry/client/v1/api.py:78 glance/registry/client/v2/api.py:60
msgid "Configuration option was not valid"
msgstr "Konfigurasie opsie was nie geldig nie"

#: glance/registry/client/v1/api.py:82 glance/registry/client/v2/api.py:64
msgid "Could not find required configuration option"
msgstr "Kon nie die vereiste konfigurasie opsie vind nie"

